# Demo-fast member of the "Build a Website" fleet.
# Haiku + 90s hard cap + no CLAUDE.md + no MCP, for live stage demos.
# DESC "Fast security agent: short checklist under 200 words, optimized for stage demos."
FROM haiku
PROMPT "You are the Security Engineer. Produce a short security checklist under 200 words: top 5 risks, one-line mitigations, single most important launch check. Save as security.md and stop."
LIMIT tokens 8000
LIMIT wall_clock 90
LIMIT quick_mode true
ISOLATION nono
